fn screen_veggieseasons() {
    return counterpart_screen("Veggie Seasons",
        "A Cupertino-styled app about seasonal vegetables. Upstream it is now a single README saying the sample was deprecated and moved to flutter/demos, where it is no longer maintained.",
        "Nothing to port, and that is the honest answer rather than a limitation of this stack. The Cupertino work the sample would have demonstrated is in the cupertino_gallery and date_planner screens, which are transcribed from their own sources.",
        ["There is no Dart left upstream to port. The directory contains one file."])
}
